# Personnel example #4: PI Funding Cards, updated 2026-10-29.
# Base: main at 6cf26319ab2f8b89706677ccfacd83fddb2de46b.
# Compact, full-width cards group all positions under one employee.
# The collapsed summary always shows current PI-distributed salary, CBR,
# and total, plus role descriptions, employee ID, and a distinct project count.
# Expand a card to see its project funding table with FE Start / FE End tooltips.
# Multiple positions are identified within the project rows.
# Full job/other-PI salary, CBR, and total are never rendered in this option.
# Page totals sum the same current, known funding entries as the employee cards.
# Future entries are opt-in and never increase current summary/page amounts.
# Future-only and unknown amounts show dashes; partial amounts are identified.
# Employee/project search updates the cards, page totals, and filtered export.
# All other examples remain archived separately.
# Restore selectively against subsequent edits rather than blindly applying.

# Employee ID sits beside the name with its small, muted styling.
# Projects appears above its count beside the monthly figures.

